# Paths only a person may approve.
#
# The review agent (alpha-review-bot) may approve and auto-merge a PR only when it touches none
# of these paths: the agent-merge ruleset (szyfkj/alpha-deploy rulesets/) requires a code
# owner's review, and a file matched by no line below has no owner. There is deliberately no
# `*` line. GitHub reads this file from the base branch. See alpha-deploy docs/AGENT_MERGE.md.
#
# Keep this list to what a wrong merge would make expensive: data, money, access, secrets,
# deploys, and the instructions agents follow. Add the app's new sensitive paths as they appear.

# The site's build, theme and configuration (pages under docs/, guide/ and i18n/ have no owner)
/docusaurus.config.ts               @phoenixluo
/src/                               @phoenixluo
/package.json                       @phoenixluo
/pnpm-lock.yaml                     @phoenixluo
/tsconfig.json                      @phoenixluo

# CI and deploy
/.github/                           @phoenixluo

# What agents read as instructions
CLAUDE.md                           @phoenixluo
AGENTS.md                           @phoenixluo
/.claude/                           @phoenixluo
/docs/knowledge/                    @phoenixluo
